#. Description of the plugin
#: wp-svg-safe.php
msgid "Allow SVG and SVGZ uploads safely. Role-based permission, a strict allowlist sanitizer with no external library, correct dimensions, media library previews and WP-CLI re-sanitizing."
msgstr ""

